[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:09.24]left a single note and went on their way
[00:18.90]I never got their name until the credits
[00:29.20]now it plays here every single day
[00:33.84]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:39.16]One note at a time
[00:43.80]from people passing through
[00:48.82]a name beside a line
[00:52.58]and part of it is you
[01:00.42]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
